@lang en
IMPORT prelude

-- ===========================================================================
-- IL-07: a figure PUBLISHED BY THE ISRAEL TAX AUTHORITY that no composed row
-- carries. NOT ENCODED LAW.
--
-- The amount in ITO s 121B(a) for a tax year is an income ceiling that s 120B
-- adjusts; for 2025-2027 s 120B(e)(1) fixes it at its 1 January 2024 figure after
-- rounding. Row IL-03 takes that figure as an input and could not source it
-- (its NOTES.md section 7; its tests use the consolidation's editorial note,
-- 721,560, as a labelled scenario value). The Tax Authority's own 2026
-- withholding booklet prints it.
--
-- [booklet-2026] "לוח עזר לחישוב מס הכנסה ממשכורת ושכר עבודה" for tax year 2026:
--   the same file row IL-01 cites for the monthly credit-point figure.
--   gov.il URL: https://www.gov.il/BlobFolder/generalpage/income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet/he/generalInformation_income-tax-monthly-deductions-booklet_monthly-deductions-booklet-2026.pdf
--   fetched:    https://web.archive.org/web/20260207101513id_/<that URL>, on
--               2026-10-06T22:02:54Z, directly (no proxy), 610,829 bytes, 36 pp.
--   sha256:     282bb886ccae1cc718840127af378fce88ca37ee3b2b9f00ed2cd44467e86285
--               (the sha256 row IL-01 recorded for the same capture)
--   PDF p. 8 (printed page 7), "מס נוסף על הכנסות גבוהות", three lines as
--   `pdftotext -layout` gives them with bidi controls removed. The extractor
--   moves punctuation and the currency sign about; the words and figures are
--   the page's ("an individual whose taxable income in the tax year exceeded
--   NIS 721,560 (NIS 60,130 a month) is liable to additional tax on the part
--   above it, at 3%"):
--     על פי סעיף 121ב לפקודה ,יחיד אשר הכנסתו החייבת בשנת המס עלתה על ₪ 721,560
--     ( ₪ 60,130לחודש) ,יהיה חייב במס נוסף על חלק הכנסתו החייבת העולה על הסכום הנ"ל ,בשיעור
--     של .3%
-- The figure agrees with the consolidation's editorial note on s 121B(a)
-- (source line 4456, "בשנים 2024–2027, 721,560 ש״ח"), which is an aid and not law.
--
-- A caveat on this booklet, recorded in NOTES.md section 7: its 2026 bracket
-- table (PDF p. 7) predates the Economic Efficiency Law (Budget Year 2026)
-- 5786-2026, which widened two brackets from 1 January 2026; the s 121B figure
-- is not among the amounts that Law changed.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `IL-07 — a figure the Israel Tax Authority published, not encoded law`

@ref [booklet-2026] PDF p. 8; ITO s 121B(a) (source line 4456)
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`IL-07 holds the s 121B(a) amount for tax year 2026 only` MEANS
    REFUSE "IL-07 holds the s 121B(a) amount for tax year 2026 only"

@ref [booklet-2026] PDF p. 8, sha256 282bb886...6e86285; ITO s 121B(a) (source line 4456), s 120B(e)(1) (source line 4344)
GIVEN `the tax year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`IL-07: the amount in section 121B(a) the Israel Tax Authority published for tax year` `the tax year` MEANS
    IF   `the tax year` EQUALS 2026
    THEN 721_560
    ELSE `IL-07 holds the s 121B(a) amount for tax year 2026 only`
